{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/791698-modern-gods","id":791698,"title":"Modern Gods","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-12-23T11:15:03-08:00","id":791698,"title":"Modern Gods","content":"I was reading a book the other day called 'A Madness of Angels' which was all about urban magic (stuff like using an underground ticket to create a ward, summoning creatures like Litterbugs and dragons made of concrete and the idea struck me, why can't Scion have modern gods?<br /> As an idea for one of the gods, there was a being(s) which called it(them)self(selves) the blue electric angels. Basically, they were the embodiment of data and electricity. Other beings in the book were The Bag Lady, The Beggar King, Lady Neon (who rules the nightlife) and Blackout.<br /> I just thought that it would be an interesting idea for a pantheon. Might need to come up with a few new Purviews though.<br /> Maybe their Pantheon Purview could be something to do with interfacing with cities or something like that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-23T11:36:37-08:00","id":791706,"title":"","content":"Ideas for gods (names in <b>bold</b>) :<br /> <br /> Electricity, machines, light, data, prophecy, fire - <b>The Copper Angel </b>(?) (Other names: <b>The Electron Seer</b>)<br /> <br /> The masses, revolution, family, growing things - <b>The Good Man </b>(Other names: <b>Everyman</b>, <b>The Lord of the Many</b>, <b>The Common Lord</b>)<br /> <br /> Nightlife, fertility, sex - <b>Lady Neon</b><br /> <br /> Workers, builders, buildings, earth, concrete, cities -<br /> <br /> Rulers, the rich, law - <b>The King in Silk </b>(a play on The King in Green, a name for the Celtic god of nature and plants)<br /> <br /> Death, cold, starvation, the homeless - <b>The Silent One</b><br /> <br /> Advancement, science / magic, tradition (two aspects) -<br /> <br /> Darkness, blackouts, crime, shadows -<br /> <br /> <br /> Any ideas for names, purviews etc would be greatly appreciated.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":10397,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","user":"ajf115","date":". 12-24-2015, 05:04 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-23T11:52:55-08:00","id":791722,"title":"","content":"Many gods already took in those principles. Take Raiden for example, who is often seen as a Hacker or Programmer. Also, theres always the idea of Scions taking on the more recent developements of humanity as their aspect of Godhood, which pretty much covers what you want, I guess. <br /> <br /> As for Purviews, you may be interested in the Atlantean &quot;Scire&quot; Purview, which pretty much deals with inventions, consequences and ideas. Also there have been some fan-made Purviews like Forge, who also go in that general direction. I'd suggest Telgars thread about Fan-Written Scion Material right <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1377-fan-written-scion-material\">here</a> to read up to it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8325-asmael","name":"Asmael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8325_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-23T12:08:05-08:00","id":791731,"title":"","content":"I know about the various gods taking on the forms or professions of the modern world, but they're not actually <i>of</i> the modern world. I think it would be a group of powerful scions that achieved Godhood fairly recently and managed to form their own pantheon. Thanks for the thing about Scire though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-23T12:20:13-08:00","id":791736,"title":"","content":"If its that what you want, then you are right, a group of young Scions would do nicely. Bear in mind, however, that gods have evolved with humanity and on a much bigger scale than &quot;just&quot; a few hundred years, so its not that unlikely that they go on and get new faces. You can see this in the Yankee Pantheon specifically, where some of the gods there are new incarnations of very old gods, who adjusted a bit to fit in better with a modern mythology. So an idea would be a Pantheon composed of old gods whose Pantheons are dead now and they decide to huddle together and modernize their aspects a little.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8325-asmael","name":"Asmael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8325_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-23T12:22:55-08:00","id":791738,"title":"","content":"Also, I just love the idea of being able to take the Angel's boasting in A Madness of Angels in that scene where it(they) go(es) &quot;We are the gods in the wire. We are bigger, brighter, faster than you could ever be.&quot; and rehash it from a Scion's perspective. Also, I smell juicy roleplay opportunities with the Scions of the modern gods being looked down on by those of the older pantheons and then showing them up and going &quot;Well, I guess you must just be out of date then.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-23T16:24:25-08:00","id":791842,"title":"","content":"Scion is kinda all about becoming the Gods of the Modern Age. I see nothing wrong with Ascended Scions taking on such roles. That's the whole thing about Scion: God even existing, right?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm a professor! Why is no one listening to me?!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/235-telgar","name":"Telgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar235_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-23T17:36:07-08:00","id":791871,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/791698-modern-gods?p=791731#post791731\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I know about the various gods taking on the forms or professions of the modern world, but they're not actually <i>of</i> the modern world. I think it would be a group of powerful scions that achieved Godhood fairly recently and managed to form their own pantheon. Thanks for the thing about Scire though.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, this is precisely <b>Scion</b>'s jam.<br /> <br /> <b>Scion</b>'s really about three things, to me. The first is <i>relationships</i>, and how who you are relates to what people in the world think of you. The second is <i>myths in the modern day</i>; that is to say, ancient mores and legends clashing with modern idealism and morality. The third, related to the second, is as you said - <i>modern myth</i>, primeval elemental associations with the world and the modern era, the synergy between what has changed in the modern era and what never changes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Neall Raemonn Price</span><br /> Beleaguered Scion Developer</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/137-neall","name":"Neall","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1204"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-23T18:00:50-08:00","id":791877,"title":"","content":"<br /> <br /> <br /> Rulers, the rich, law - <b>The Man</b><br /> <br /> <br /> Death, cold, starvation, the homeless - <b>Poverty </b>(or)<b> The Machine</b><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Interestingly enough, I was considering an idea for a machine based Purview as well, but then realize that any Craft specialist could effectively do the same thing. Especially a Greek Scion with Arete.<br /> <br /> <br /> The Yankee Pantheon's PSP is based around Industry, and even includes a portable nuke!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 12-23-2015, 09:04 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-23T18:25:12-08:00","id":791887,"title":"","content":"Several of rapper Lupe Fiasco's songs, particularly those on the album <i>The Cool,</i> feature an undead gangbanger and his troubled relationships with two other supernatural figures -- <b>The Streets,</b> a seductive goddess of fame and pleasure similar to ajf115's Lady Neon; and <b>The Game,</b> a demonic embodiment of crime, vice, and violence.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?sa=t&amp;rct=j&amp;q=&amp;esrc=s&amp;source=video&amp;cd=4&amp;cad=rja&amp;uact=8&amp;ved=0ahUKEwj-yIDrt_PJAhUIbSYKHYbLCGAQtwIIJjAD&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2Fwatch%3Fv%3D0fXujLPRpw0&amp;usg=AFQjCNEi7fMG2viR9_j3Wih1_b1hsZtCpQ&amp;sig2=jtCwHbDHtMPyzVm3AzZz0Q\" target=\"_blank\">The Cool</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?sa=t&amp;rct=j&amp;q=&amp;esrc=s&amp;source=video&amp;cd=3&amp;cad=rja&amp;uact=8&amp;ved=0ahUKEwj-yIDrt_PJAhUIbSYKHYbLCGAQtwIIIzAC&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2Fwatch%3Fv%3Dll9c1S3d_v4&amp;usg=AFQjCNE8Q2m0DY9WEVQOS_c1ss8iqeLFwQ&amp;sig2=4SoF6LaPurvqkTk5iOV9Rw\" target=\"_blank\">The Coolest</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?sa=t&amp;rct=j&amp;q=&amp;esrc=s&amp;source=web&amp;cd=1&amp;cad=rja&amp;uact=8&amp;ved=0ahUKEwjbrrL8s_PJAhUBOiYKHRpeDXAQtwIIHTAA&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2Fwatch%3Fv%3DUF7rBcFolAc&amp;usg=AFQjCNFyUcyL_Cf2PfN0djRXkm714lkV-Q&amp;sig2=Nqk8eP2lXm2Td6FMGkl6Aw\" target=\"_blank\">Streets on Fire</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?sa=t&amp;rct=j&amp;q=&amp;esrc=s&amp;source=video&amp;cd=1&amp;cad=rja&amp;uact=8&amp;ved=0ahUKEwjkmOy8uPPJAhUDQCYKHZJAC_MQtwIIHTAA&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2Fwatch%3Fv%3DrBgSijwAtmQ&amp;usg=AFQjCNFqn9TerEIJtxWA_sCokn13OaNiVA&amp;sig2=ZZ8CMi7FihMMjejXZGOINA\" target=\"_blank\">Put You on Game</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/40-dspaul","name":"DSPaul","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-23T21:30:00-08:00","id":791959,"title":"","content":"Deleted For Reasons. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-24T02:06:04-08:00","id":792052,"title":"","content":"I think that the most important thing for all of these gods would be that they all have a dark side. Lady Neon is the patron of nightclubs and romance but also of STDs, break ups and drugs. The Copper Angel is the god of the internet, computers, lightbulbs and information but also of cybercrime, car crashes and spy cameras. The Good Man id the lord of family and farms but also of bloody revolution.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-24T02:06:37-08:00","id":792053,"title":"","content":"They reflect the modern world.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-24T02:57:53-08:00","id":792070,"title":"","content":"Also, maybe there should be an antagonist god, like Set in the Pesedjet. Maybe a god of floods etc.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-24T07:46:17-08:00","id":792170,"title":"","content":"Set isn't just an antagonistic god. In fact he does help the Pesedjet by defending Atum-Res Solar Bark against Apep every night. So just calling him &quot;evil&quot; isn't doing his character justice. Set is a god of bad, cruel and sometimes outright violent, but still necessary principles.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8325-asmael","name":"Asmael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8325_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-24T08:06:51-08:00","id":792181,"title":"","content":"Marvel comics made Set evil. As Asmael stated he was both a guardian of Ra and the war god who protected the Pesedjet. He is certainly no more cruel than any other god. Take a look at Isis for a minute. Many of her actions are pretty harsh and completely self centered.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/333-achilles","name":"Achilles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar333_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"81"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-24T08:47:30-08:00","id":792199,"title":"","content":"I didn't mean that he was simply evil, just seen as 'worse' than the others because he was the god of the desert, the lands where life could not flourish. Perhaps Set was a bad comparison. I thought that there might be space for a kind of destroyer-god (perhaps analogous with Shiva?) whose task it is to destroy that which is outdated and dysfunctional to make space for new growth and development. Perhaps he could be a brother or counterpart to the god of building and construction.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbco